Cek tabel
SHOW TABLES;

Harus muncul:

categories
menus
transaction_details
transactions
users

Keluar dari MariaDB:

EXIT;
Tahap 3 - Membuat Project Node.js

Masuk ke folder project:

cd ~/cafepos

Kalau folder belum ada:

mkdir ~/cafepos
cd ~/cafepos
Inisialisasi
npm init -y
Install semua package
npm install express ejs mysql2 express-session bcrypt dotenv body-parser multer uuid

Install juga agar server otomatis restart saat pengembangan:

npm install --save-dev nodemon
Buat struktur folder
mkdir routes controllers middleware config models views public
mkdir public/css public/js public/images

Strukturnya menjadi:

cafepos/
│
├── app.js
├── package.json
├── .env
├── config/
├── controllers/
├── middleware/
├── models/
├── routes/
├── views/
└── public/
    ├── css/
    ├── js/
    └── images/
